Subject: [PATCH] Publish WOW64 continuations at gated backward control transfers

Family: CondJump NZCV/CBZ/CBNZ/TBZ/TBNZ, Jump/stitching, fast return.
Gate absent/0 retains old control transfer behavior; 1/2 explicit experiments.
WOW64 fault at page+16 identifies a published RIP; unprotect whole base page.
ARM64EC product DLL remains byte-identical to the tested x64 review.
Bounded protection diagnostic is outside the handler; no first-use work in handler.
R1/live evidence and residual R2/bounded-loop debt are listed in handoff reports.
Target 1.0.8; default decision belongs to owner. Audit completed: yes.

